  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the percentage of all the monochlorinated products obtained from the chlorination of 2 - methyl butane. The relative reactivity of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mo>∘</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math>, <math> <mrow> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mo>∘</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math>, and <math> <mrow> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mo>∘</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> hydrogen to chlorination is (1 : 3.8 : 5).",
    "image": null
  },
